  "description": "The CarboKev frameset is where Curve's hybrid construction really shows its work. 3D-printed titanium lugs bond to carbon tubes using double-lap joints at every critical junction — a construction method that delivers a lighter, stiffer platform than Curve's full-titanium Big Kev, without giving up the long-distance comfort riders expect.\nPaired with the Race 415i fork and Neo Plug internal brake hose routing, this frameset is built for a genuinely race-ready setup from the ground up. The CarboKev Splatter Art finish comes standard with custom options available through Candy Factory Paintworks for riders who want something even more personal.\nThis is the frame for riders who want to spec their own CarboKev build from the frame out.",
